<title>USA: Astrosystems to make $5-shr payout by June.</title>
<headline>Astrosystems to make $5-shr payout by June.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Astrosystems Inc said it will make an initial cash distribution of $5 per share to its shareholders no later than June 30 under its plan to completely liquidate its assets and dissolve the company.</p>
<p>As of September 30, the company had net assets in liquidation of $6.19 per share, it said.</p>
<p>The company has been operating under the plan of liquidation since shareholders approved the plan on February 2 of last year.</p>
